abstract: >-
  Attention-based keyword extraction framework. Zero training, zero labeling,
  single forward pass. Supports Chinese and English. Evaluated on 7 public
  datasets against 14 methods. Includes QK LoRA fine-tuning on
  Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B, outperforming Gemini flash-lite by +14% F1@10
  with ~500x faster inference.
